    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Hardware encompasses all physical and tangible parts of a computer system.",
        "Software consists of the programs, routines, and procedures that govern hardware operation.",
        "Firmware acts as fixed software written into hardware devices like ROM.",
        "Humanware highlights the role of users, programmers, and administrators operating computer systems."
